#. いや…証拠は俺が握ってるんだ！
#. オメーらの証拠は偽物だ！
msgctxt "0001 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "No! I've got the evidence! Your guys' is all fake!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Mình cần phải suy nghĩ lại một lần nữa. Chắc chắn phải có\n"
"điểm mâu thuẫn nào đó trong này...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>３人共が…周りの全員を敵だと思い込んでいるなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All three of them think that everyone around them is\n"
"their enemy...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなの、間違いなくモノクマの罠だ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no doubt this is a trap Monokuma's set!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクらが互いに疑い合うように、
#. あいつが仕組んだんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He set it up so we would suspect each other...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>３人共が…周りの全員を敵だと思い込んでいるなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All three of them think that everyone around them is\n"
"their enemy...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなの、間違いなくモノクマの罠だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no doubt this is a trap Monokuma's set!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクらが互いに疑い合うように、
#. あいつが仕組んだんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He set it up so we would suspect each other...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクも持っている…<CLT><CLT 3>例の物<CLT><CLT 4>で…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And I have <CLT><CLT 3>something that proves it<CLT><CLT 4>...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
